    {
      "id": "sec_dg_player",
      "background": {
        "type": "color",
        "token": "surface"
      },
      "padding": "md",
      "minHeight": "auto",
      "align": "top",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_4614a7d9",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 12,
            "row": 7,
            "rowSpan": 4
          },
          "mobile": {
            "layout": {
              "row": 6,
              "rowSpan": 8
            }
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "<strong>Weapons</strong>: As a roguelike adventure, weapons and projectile are crucial to Dawngeon. It's a way to make each run unique, and combining unique weapons, items, and upgrades allow for crazy combos.",
            "variant": "body",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_315de8ed",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 12,
            "row": 12,
            "rowSpan": 3
          },
          "mobile": {
            "layout": {
              "row": 15,
              "rowSpan": 10
            }
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "<strong>AI</strong>: I programmed pathfinding, decision-making, and combat tactics layered on a state machine. The state machine has three simple states: patrol, chase, attack. This was only made possibly by watching and learning from countless Brackeys Video.",
            "variant": "body",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_ee5b7da7",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 12,
            "row": 17,
            "rowSpan": 4
          },
          "mobile": {
            "layout": {
              "row": 27,
              "rowSpan": 10
            }
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "<strong>Procedurally generated world</strong>: I programmed a dungeon generator that composes modular rooms, enemy distributions, and item placements differently every run. As replayability is the genre's promise, this was one of the crutical gameplay feature.",
            "variant": "body",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_37547a47",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 12,
            "row": 22,
            "rowSpan": 4
          },
          "mobile": {
            "layout": {
              "row": 38,
              "rowSpan": 7
            }
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "<strong>Cooking</strong>: I conceptualized and implemented a cooking system. Inspired by Legend of Zelda BOTW, Players can combine ingredients found in the dungeon into meals that heal and hand out buffs. ",
            "variant": "body",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_8c18e31b",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 12,
            "row": 27,
            "rowSpan": 3
          },
          "mobile": {
            "layout": {
              "row": 46,
              "rowSpan": 7
            }
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "<strong>Narrative</strong>: I designed the entire narrative of the game. I developed a story mode which mixed roguelike gameplay and cutscenes in my handcrafted 2D pixel world. ",
            "variant": "body",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_57e35860",
          "layout": {
            "col": 1,
            "colSpan": 12,
            "row": 2,
            "rowSpan": 3
          },
          "mobile": {
            "layout": {
              "row": 1
            }
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "Highlights",
            "variant": "h3",
